tart` anywhere.\n- `memopayload.Runner` — has a `RunOnce` batch method (`server/runner/memopayload/runner.go:19-72`) shaped exactly like the s3presign runner, but nothing calls `memopayload.NewRunner` or `Runner.RunOnce`; `server.go` never imports the `memopayload` package. Only the standalone `RebuildMemoPayload` function is used, called synchronously inside memo create/update handlers (`server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:108`, `:447`), not as a scheduled/background job.","iteration":14,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
